#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Take a 20-question exam on the IBM Training site to test your quantum "
"machine learning skills and receive a badge through Credly."
msgstr ""
"Kumuha ng pagsusulit na may 20 tanong sa IBM Training site para subukan ang "
"iyong mga kakayahan sa quantum machine learning at makatanggap ng badge sa "
"pamamagitan ng Credly."

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exam | Quantum machine learning"
msgstr "Pagsusulit | Quantum machine learning"

