# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Post-course survey {#post-course-survey}"
msgstr "Survey pagkatapos ng kurso {#post-course-survey}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Congratulations on completing this course! Please take a moment to help us "
"improve our course by filling out the following [quick "
"survey](https://your.feedback.ibm.com/jfe/form/SV_a68ils4bH0vX0O2). Your "
"feedback will be used to enhance our content offering and user experience. "
"Thank you!\n"
msgstr ""
"> **Note:** This survey is provided by IBM Quantum and relates to the "
"original English content. To give feedback on doQumentation's website, "
"translations, or code execution, please [open a GitHub "
"issue](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/issues).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Test your knowledge {#test-your-knowledge}"
msgstr "Subukan ang iyong kaalaman {#test-your-knowledge}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After completing the reading and activities in this course, click the button"
" below to navigate to IBM&reg; Training, where you can take the badging exam"
" for Quantum machine learning.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pagkatapos makumpleto ang mga pagbabasa at aktibidad sa kursong ito, i-click"
" ang button sa ibaba para pumunta sa IBM&reg; Training, kung saan maaari "
"kang kumuha ng badging exam para sa Quantum machine learning.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The exam consists of 20 questions, and you must answer at least 16 correctly"
" to pass. Upon receiving a passing score, your badge will automatically be "
"sent to the email you used to register with IBM Training.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ang pagsusulit ay binubuo ng 20 tanong, at kailangan mong sagutin nang tama "
"ang hindi bababa sa 16 para makapasa. Kapag nakatanggap ng passing score, "
"awtomatikong maipapadala ang iyong badge sa email na ginamit mo sa "
"pagpaparehistro sa IBM Training.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Make sure you're ready to take the exam. If you don't receive a passing "
"score in two attempts, the exam becomes temporarily locked.\n"
msgstr ""
"Siguraduhing handa ka na bago kumuha ng pagsusulit. Kung hindi ka makakakuha"
" ng passing score sa dalawang pagsubok, pansamantalang mala-lock ang "
"pagsusulit.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Notice: These exams on the IBM Training site may be temporarily unavailable "
"in the next few days, due to maintenance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Paalala: Maaaring pansamantalang hindi available ang mga pagsusulit na ito "
"sa IBM Training site sa susunod na ilang araw dahil sa maintenance.\n"

